  "description": "Brock DeLappe is delighted to present this beautifully presented two-bedroom house to the rental market, ideally located on Niall Street in the highly sought-after, vibrant neighbourhood of Stoneybatter, Dublin 7.\n\nPresented in excellent condition and furnished to a high standard, this attractive home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a stylish contemporary finish throughout. The property combines the character and charm of a traditional Dublin home with the convenience of a modern interior, making it an excellent rental opportunity in one of Dublin 7’s most popular locations.\n\nOn entering the property, you are welcomed into a bright, inviting open-plan living and dining area, featuring solid wooden flooring throughout, attractive furnishings, and an original period fireplace that provides an excellent focal point. The generous living space is complemented by excellent natural light and provides a comfortable setting for both relaxing and entertaining.\n\nThe modern fitted kitchen is particularly impressive, featuring a contemporary L-shaped design with extensive fitted cabinetry, excellent countertop space and integrated appliances. The kitchen also benefits from a bright and airy layout, with large bi-fold doors opening directly onto the private southwest-facing paved patio.\n\nThe property offers two bedrooms, comprising one generous double bedroom and a single bedroom. Both bedrooms are well presented and benefit from fitted wardrobes and quality flooring, providing excellent storage and comfortable accommodation.\n\nThe contemporary bathroom is finished to a high standard and features stylish tiled walls and flooring, a large walk-in shower, a modern vanity unit, a WC and attractive contemporary fittings.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private southwest-facing paved patio area, providing a valuable outdoor space and an excellent extension of the living accommodation during the warmer months.\n\nThe property also benefits from parking, central heating and a modern overall specification.\n\nNiall Street is ideally positioned within Stoneybatter, one of Dublin 7’s most popular residential neighbourhoods, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, independent shops and local amenities all within easy walking distance. The property is also exceptionally well positioned for access to Dublin city centre, with Smithfield, the Phoenix Park, Grangegorman and Heuston Station all within easy reach.\n\nThe area is particularly well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes available nearby and the Luas also accessible from the surrounding area, providing convenient connections throughout Dublin.\n\nThis is a superb opportunity to rent a beautifully presented home in an established and highly sought-after Dublin 7 location.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended",
